C</source><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><comment>April 2001</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Clinical Resource Efficiency Support Team</collab></person-group><article-title>Guidance on the prevention and treatment of osteoporosis.</article-title><source>Belfast</source><year>2001</year><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>35</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kin Yuen</surname><given-names>Chui</given-names></name><name><surname>Kendler</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Khan</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Fortier</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Osteoporosis.</article-title><source>J Obstet Gynaecol Can</source><year>2001</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>978</fpage><lpage>9</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Klibanski</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Adams-Campbell</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Bassford</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Osteoporosis prevention, diagnosis, and therapy.</article-title><source>NIH Consensus Conference</source><year>2000</year><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>45</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>London department of health. Osteoporosis.</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.doh.gov.uk/pub/docs/doh/osteo.pdf"/><comment>November 2001</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Osteoporosis; diagnostics and pharmacotherapy.</article-title><source>Finland: Evidence-based guidelines</source><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink